        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.3,
          "end": 68.32,
          "en": "in the deployment course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.32,
          "end": 70.36,
          "en": "And you can apply what you learned there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.36,
          "end": 73.07,
          "en": "to add an environment variable of that name,",
