        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.02000000000001,
          "end": 105.95,
          "en": "where you could set environment variables and their values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.95,
          "end": 109.02000000000001,
          "en": "And there you could also set this environment variable",
